00:07:54.078 --> 00:07:57.101
Which makes no sense because
unless you're going to die,

00:07:57.101 --> 00:07:59.763
you should only play long term.

00:07:59.763 --> 00:08:03.777
There was a stat that some
dude in Mexico City said,

00:08:03.777 --> 00:08:05.225
one of these futurist type-of characters,

00:08:05.225 --> 00:08:06.548
I'm sure he's smart, I have no idea who,

00:08:06.548 --> 00:08:09.338
but he was right before
me as I was miked up

00:08:09.338 --> 00:08:11.917
and he says "it's been
scientifically proven"

00:08:11.917 --> 00:08:13.044
so I don't know if it has or not

00:08:13.044 --> 00:08:16.267
because I've learned to take
that with a grain of salt

00:08:16.267 --> 00:08:20.081
but that 85% of what
humans make decisions about

00:08:20.081 --> 00:08:21.909
is irrational.

00:08:21.909 --> 00:08:23.086
And that spoke to me.

00:08:23.086 --> 00:08:25.540
Because, A, I think it's higher.

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:29.581
And, B, it's why I think
all my success is happening.

00:08:29.581 --> 00:08:32.599
I am stunningly the most rational

00:08:32.599 --> 00:08:34.543
and the most practical of all,

00:08:34.543 --> 00:08:36.210
yet I don't seem it.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:39.699
And when he said it, I was like, right.

00:08:39.699 --> 00:08:40.679
That's why.

00:08:40.679 --> 00:08:44.429
Because the rest of the
market is irrational.

00:08:49.272 --> 00:08:51.004
Not on what I say.

00:08:51.004 --> 00:08:53.790
I don't care if you want
to hustle 18 hours a day.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:54.950
I really don't.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:56.229
I really really don't.

00:08:56.229 --> 00:08:58.487
I don't care if you want
to buy the New York Jets.

00:08:58.487 --> 00:09:01.806
I don't care what you want or need.

00:09:01.806 --> 00:09:04.192
You need to care about
what you want and need.

00:09:04.192 --> 00:09:06.333
You can't worry about what I'm saying.

00:09:06.333 --> 00:09:09.105
You can't worry about whoever
your flavor of the month is.

00:09:09.105 --> 00:09:10.958
Maybe I'm your flavor
of the month right now.

00:09:10.958 --> 00:09:14.494
Maybe, your consistent flavor of the life

00:09:14.494 --> 00:09:17.390
is your mom's point of
view, is your older brother

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.039
who's guided you with good wisdom,

00:09:19.039 --> 00:09:20.684
but wants you to be a lawyer,

00:09:20.684 --> 00:09:21.837
but you don't want to be a lawyer.

00:09:21.837 --> 00:09:23.025
You want to be a street artist.

00:09:23.025 --> 00:09:25.599
You want to take the chance
of being an entrepreneur.

00:09:25.599 --> 00:09:27.920
Or the reverse, or the reverse.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.451
I, nobody preaches and loves
entrepreneurship more than me

00:09:30.451 --> 00:09:31.734
but I think you see me all the time

00:09:31.734 --> 00:09:33.453
talking about self-awareness.

00:09:33.453 --> 00:09:34.361
Are you one.

00:09:34.361 --> 00:09:36.945
This is the golden era
for entrepreneurship.

00:09:36.945 --> 00:09:38.449
People ask me for selfies.

00:09:38.449 --> 00:09:39.833
This will go away.

00:09:39.833 --> 00:09:41.199
It may not go away for me,

00:09:41.199 --> 00:09:43.878
but it's going to go away.

00:09:43.878 --> 00:09:48.295
Entrepreneurship, like a rap
artist, like a baseball player,

00:09:48.295 --> 00:09:49.386
like the heavyweight, nobody cares

00:09:49.386 --> 00:09:52.094
who the heavyweight champion
of the world is right now.

00:09:52.094 --> 00:09:54.785
Nobody cares who's an active astronaut.

00:09:54.785 --> 00:09:57.518
But they surely did in 1969

00:09:57.518 --> 00:10:00.435
and 1954 for the heavyweight champ.

00:10:01.389 --> 00:10:03.301
They change, they change

00:10:03.301 --> 00:10:07.053
and it will always change and
it will continuously change

00:10:07.053 --> 00:10:10.142
and right now entrepreneurship
is in this pedestal

00:10:10.142 --> 00:10:11.969
that's having its moment

00:10:11.969 --> 00:10:13.793
and what I'm fearful of is

00:10:13.793 --> 00:10:17.855
that you watch my videos and
you see my Instagram quotes

00:10:17.855 --> 00:10:19.491
and what I want to
clarify for everybody is

00:10:19.491 --> 00:10:20.840
that I hope you understand

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.801
I am not giving advice to everybody.

00:10:22.801 --> 00:10:25.529
The only advice I'd like
to give to everybody

00:10:25.529 --> 00:10:26.562
is to do you.

00:10:26.562 --> 00:10:28.057
To find what your North star is,

00:10:28.057 --> 00:10:29.414
to understand yourself,

00:10:29.414 --> 00:10:32.555
to understand what your
work-life balance ambitions are,

00:10:32.555 --> 00:10:34.931
how much, what your
financial ambitions are,

00:10:34.931 --> 00:10:37.053
what your life challenges are,

00:10:37.053 --> 00:10:39.872
the problems that you want
to try to solve and cure

00:10:39.872 --> 00:10:42.003
as we all do as humans try to climb

00:10:42.003 --> 00:10:43.623
those different mountains in our lives.

00:10:43.623 --> 00:10:45.081
What makes you tick.

00:10:45.081 --> 00:10:46.504
That is all that matters.

00:10:46.504 --> 00:10:48.822
Don't do, I don't do DailyVee

00:10:48.822 --> 00:10:51.286
